<title>BELGIUM: EU sees end 96/97 intvn grain stocks at 5.2 mln T.</title>
<headline>EU sees end 96/97 intvn grain stocks at 5.2 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union intervention grain stocks are expected to rise to 5.2 million tonnes at the end of 1996/97 (July/June), from 2.7 million tonnes at the end of 1995/96, the European Commission's agriculture directorate general said in a market analysis.</p>
<p>But intervention wheat stocks are seen falling to zero, from 500,000 tonnes over the same period.</p>
</text>
